concept:australian-citizenship-amendment-intercountry-adoption-act-2015-sch-1-sec-6 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "6 Subsection 19C(4) (definition of adoption compliance"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-6 ;
    values:originalText "certificate) Repeal the definition, substitute: adoption compliance certificate:  (a) for an adoption in accordance with the Hague Convention on Intercountry Adoption—has the same meaning as in the Intercountry Adoption regulations; and  (b) for an adoption in accordance with a bilateral arrangement— has the same meaning as in the Bilateral Arrangements regulations." ;
