concept:australian-citizenship-amendment-intercountry-adoption-act-2015-sch-1-sec-9 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "9 Application"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-9 ;
    values:originalText "The amendments made by this Schedule apply in relation to an application made under section 19C of the Australian Citizenship Act 2007 on or after the day this item commences by a person adopted outside Australia by an Australian citizen in accordance with a bilateral arrangement, even if the adoption occurred before that day.  [Minister’s second reading speech made in— House of Representatives on 29 May 2014 Senate on 25 September 2014]  (108/14) ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00007" ;
    skos:definition "The amendments made by this Schedule apply in relation to an application made under section 19C of the Australian Citizenship Act 2007 on or after the day this item commences by a person adopted outside Australia by an Australian citizen in accordance with a bilateral arrangement, even if the adoption occurred before that day.  [Minister’s second reading speech made in— House of Representatives on 29 May 2014 Senate on 25 September 2014]  (108/14) ComLaw Authoritative Act C2015A00007"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "5718b925e6514e3e362d76641e57cfe534d9ea13088cd6fe86ca5dbf0573aab6" ;
